// Into flooded pumpworks by the east service door, up over the pump wheel (W held climbs it), down onto the
// timber landing on the viewing window's sill (keyed into the wheel's rim), S at the rope's head on its west
// end, 7 m down the rope to the dry hall floor and the chest, unhurt. Before the landing, walking on west off
// the wheel was a 7.5-10 m drop beside it (16-43 hp).
map
